    "description_html": "<ul>\n<li>High visibility reflective vinyl</li>\n<li>Waterproof</li>\n<li>Tear-resistant &amp; UV resistant</li>\n<li>Supplied on&nbsp;sheets</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Digitally printed, high visibility (Hi-Viz) reflective vinyl stickers. Any size from 0.5\"x0.5\" up to 8.81\"x8.64\".</strong></p>\n<p>Our Reflective Stickers are supplied in sheet format, not on a roll.</p>\n<p>Reflective Stickers (also referred to as reflective vinyl stickers and reflective labels) are a hardwearing, waterproof, custom sticker solution. These look particularly good with black or dark colors to contrast the light silver reflective color. They look great with a reflective background or reversed so text is reflective inside&nbsp;a black or dark background.</p>"
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "Check thresholds are the domed-sticker values from the Print MCP spec; other sticker types may need their own.",
    "sheet_in (9.25 x 10 in) is confirmed only for domed sheets (current studio + spec).",
    "white_prints_clear on Metallic and white_ink on Clear follow the product names; confirm with production.",
    "Vinyl lettering is cut from solid-color vinyl (one color, text and vector only), based on the product name 'Cut Vinyl Logos'; confirm with production."
  ],
